00:31:49.000 --> 00:32:14.000
how much it's rooted in Chinese deep history. Is Deng conscious of being the heir to a pre-communist past, first of all? Or is he still completely trapped by the communist way of thinking, that the revolution was kind of year zero, as it were? And secondly, how much are they conscious of China being this vast reservoir of untapped potential, which is obviously not the case, you know, even when you're looking at a country that turns out to be reasonably successful like Hungary or Poland or somewhere in China is a completely different order.

