00:46:58.000 --> 00:47:32.000
group who just 15 years before had been coming out of the aftermath of the greatest turmoil they had ever seen. Remember Deng Xiaoping's son, as I said, was crippled for life as a result. And seeing these demonstrators in the street made them think, we cannot allow that chaos to happen again. Completely misleading interpretation, but nonetheless, their interpretation. Because it's happening in Tiananmen Square, which had been the great kind of place where people would come and wave mouths at a red book and everything. I mean, is that one of the reasons why it happens in Tiananmen Square in Beijing in a way that it doesn't happen elsewhere because of the centrality of the location? Yes. Tiananmen Square is the absolute symbolic and political

